### relix-ask teacher-LLM response caches ###
# Stray/local caches stay ignored, but the canonical docs/llm cache IS
# committed: the checked-in query-pair.schemas.json is generated from it, so
# committing it makes corpus regeneration byte-for-byte reproducible and
# token-free (no API key needed) on any machine/CI.
*.teacher-cache.json
!docs/llm/.teacher-cache.json

### relix-ask :ask failure log (issue #470) — local debugging artifact, never committed
ask-log.jsonl
ask-log.jsonl.*
